  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Invitar:**",
      "- *Would you like to + verbo…?* → *Would you like to go to the cinema?*",
      "- *Let's + verbo* → *Let's meet at seven.* (sin *to*)",
      "- *What about + día/plan?* → *What about Saturday?*",
      "",
      "**Aceptar:** *I'd love to! · Great idea! · Yes, please.*",
      "",
      "**Rechazar con cortesía:** *Sorry, I can't. I work on Fridays.* (da un motivo).",
      "",
      "**Tiempo:** *on Friday · at seven.*"
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
